## Notes

Some in-game settings must be configured correctly, such as:

- potion slot positions
- skill key bindings
- shield key binding

This project was mainly designed for mage characters, but depending on the build and configuration, it can also work for shamans.

It is important to remember that after some time, manual movement or improvements to the movement system will still be necessary.  
This happens because the game includes mechanics that stop attacks from working properly if the character stays stationary for too long.

## Tip

Using vampirism items can greatly improve character survival, allowing the automation to run safely for a longer period of time.
